<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 343 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 343 ALL OUT V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were</p>
<p>all out for 343 in their second innings, leaving Sri Lanka with</p>
<p>a victory target of 269, on the fourth day of the second test at</p>
<p>Arnos Vale on Monday.</p>
<p>scores: West Indies 147 and 343 (B.Lara 115; M.Muralitharan</p>
<p>5-115), Sri Lanka 222.</p>
</text>
